      "text": "During the Ming Dynasty (1368–1644), martial arts manuals were published, such as the 'Ji Xiao Xin Shu' by General Qi Jiguang, which documented various martial arts techniques.",
      "date": "1368"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Qing Dynasty and the Spread of Martial Arts",
      "text": "In the Qing Dynasty (1644–1912), martial arts became more widespread among the general population, and many styles were developed and refined.",
