      "date": "1978-12"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Tiananmen Square Protests",
      "text": "In 1989, large-scale protests took place in Tiananmen Square, Beijing, calling for political reform and greater freedoms. The protests were forcibly suppressed by the government on June 4, 1989, resulting in a significant number of casualties.",
      "date": "1989-06-04"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Hong Kong Handover",
