      "headline": "Birth of Edith Wharton",
      "text": "Edith Newbold Jones, later known as Edith Wharton, was born on January 24, 1862, in New York City.",
      "date": "1862-01-24"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Marriage to Edward (Teddy) Wharton",
      "text": "In 1885, Edith married Edward (Teddy) Wharton, a wealthy Bostonian banker.",
      "date": "1885"
    },
