      "headline": "Battle of Puebla",
      "text": "On May 5, 1862, Díaz fought in the Battle of Puebla, where Mexican forces achieved a significant victory over the French.",
      "date": "1862-05-05"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Capture of Mexico City",
      "text": "Díaz was instrumental in the capture of Mexico City from the French on June 21, 1867.",
      "date": "1867-06-21"
