      "headline": "First Presidency",
      "text": "Díaz became President of Mexico for the first time on November 28, 1876, serving until December 6, 1876.",
      "date": "1876-11-28"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Second Presidency",
      "text": "Díaz assumed the presidency again on February 17, 1877, and served until December 1, 1880.",
