      "headline": "Start of the Battle of the Coral Sea",
      "text": "The Battle of the Coral Sea began on May 4, 1942, as Japanese forces aimed to capture Port Moresby in New Guinea and Tulagi in the Solomon Islands.",
      "date": "1942-05-04"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Japanese Forces Capture Tulagi",
      "text": "On May 3, 1942, Japanese forces successfully captured Tulagi, which was part of their strategy to extend their defensive perimeter in the Pacific.",
