      "headline": "Establishment of the National People's Congress",
      "text": "The National People's Congress (NPC) was established as the highest organ of state power of the People's Republic of China (PRC) in 1954. It serves as the only branch of government in China, with all state organs subservient to it.",
      "date": "1954"
