      "headline": "Charles Sanders Peirce's Lecture on Pragmatism",
      "text": "In 1878, Charles Sanders Peirce delivered a lecture titled 'How to Make Our Ideas Clear,' which introduced the concept of pragmatism. This lecture laid the groundwork for the pragmatic maxim, which suggests that the meaning of a concept is to be found in its practical effects.",
