      "headline": "Emergence of Vajrayana",
      "text": "Vajrayana Buddhism, also known as Tantric Buddhism, began to emerge in the 7th century CE in Medieval India. It developed from the Mahayana tradition and incorporated elements of Hindu Tantrism.",
      "date": "0600"
