      "text": "In 711, the Umayyad Caliphate began the conquest of the Iberian Peninsula, establishing Muslim rule in parts of what is now Spain and Portugal.",
      "date": "0711"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Battle of Tours",
      "text": "In 732, the Battle of Tours took place, where Frankish leader Charles Martel defeated an invading Muslim army, halting the northward advance of Islam from the Iberian Peninsula.",
