      "text": "USCENTCOM led Operation Desert Storm, the combat phase of the Gulf War, which began on January 17, 1991, and resulted in the liberation of Kuwait.",
      "date": "1991-01-17"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Operation Enduring Freedom",
      "text": "Following the September 11 attacks, USCENTCOM initiated Operation Enduring Freedom on October 7, 2001, targeting al-Qaeda and the Taliban in Afghanistan.",
      "date": "2001-10-07"
