      "text": "The Allied invasion of Sicily, codenamed Operation Husky, began on July 9, 1943. It was a major campaign of World War II, in which the Allies took the island of Sicily from the Axis powers (Italy and Nazi Germany).",
      "date": "1943-07-09"
