      "date": "1991-06-15"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Aftermath and Global Impact",
      "text": "The eruption of Mount Pinatubo had significant global climatic effects, including a temporary decrease in global temperatures due to the large amount of volcanic ash and sulfur dioxide released into the atmosphere.",
      "date": "1991"
