      "headline": "Formation of IG Farben",
      "text": "IG Farben was formed on December 25, 1925, from a merger of six major chemical companies: Agfa, BASF, Bayer, Chemische Fabrik Griesheim-Elektron, Hoechst, and Weiler-ter-Meer.",
