      "text": "From 1947 to 1948, several directors of IG Farben were tried at the Nuremberg Trials for war crimes and crimes against humanity, known as the IG Farben Trial.",
      "date": "1947"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Dissolution of IG Farben",
      "text": "In 1952, IG Farben was officially dissolved and its assets were divided among its original constituent companies, which were re-established as independent entities.",
      "date": "1952"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Nationalization in East Germany",
      "text": "Parts of IG Farben located in East Germany were nationalized following the dissolution of the company.",
