      "text": "On February 12, 1736, Francis III, Duke of Lorraine and Bar, married Maria Theresa of Austria. This union marked the origin of the House of Habsburg-Lorraine.",
      "date": "1736-02-12"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Francis I becomes Holy Roman Emperor",
      "text": "In 1745, Francis III, Duke of Lorraine, became Francis I, Holy Roman Emperor, following the War of the Austrian Succession.",
      "date": "1745"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Maria Theresa's Reign",
      "text": "Maria Theresa reigned as the Archduchess of Austria, Queen of Hungary, and Queen of Bohemia from 1740 until her death in 1780. She implemented numerous reforms in her territories.",
      "date": "1740"
