    },
    {
      "headline": "Creation of the Housing Choice Voucher Program",
      "text": "The Housing Choice Voucher Program was established as part of the Section 8 program, allowing recipients to choose housing in the private market and have a portion of their rent subsidized.",
      "date": "1983"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Expansion of Section 8 Assistance",
      "text": "Throughout the 1980s and 1990s, the Section 8 program expanded significantly, increasing the number of vouchers available and the range of eligible recipients.",
      "date": "1980-1999"
