      "text": "In 1939, the Academy introduced a separate category for Scoring of a Musical Picture, which was awarded alongside Best Original Score.",
      "date": "1939"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Merger of Categories",
      "text": "In 1942, the categories for Best Original Score and Scoring of a Musical Picture were merged into a single category.",
      "date": "1942"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Split into Two Categories",
      "text": "In 1947, the Academy split the category into two separate awards: Best Scoring of a Dramatic or Comedy Picture and Best Scoring of a Musical Picture.",
      "date": "1947"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Reunification of Categories",
      "text": "In 1985, the categories were once again merged into a single award for Best Original Score.",
