      "headline": "Hans-Georg Gadamer's Philosophical Hermeneutics",
      "text": "Hans-Georg Gadamer (1900-2002) developed philosophical hermeneutics, focusing on the role of history and culture in shaping understanding. His seminal work, 'Truth and Method', was published in 1960.",
