      "text": "On August 6, 1945, the United States dropped the first atomic bomb on the Japanese city of Hiroshima. This marked the first use of nuclear weapons in warfare.",
      "date": "1945-08-06"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Second Use of Nuclear Weapons",
      "text": "On August 9, 1945, the United States dropped a second atomic bomb on the Japanese city of Nagasaki.",
      "date": "1945-08-09"
    },
