      "headline": "Comprehensive Nuclear-Test-Ban Treaty",
      "text": "The Comprehensive Nuclear-Test-Ban Treaty (CTBT) was adopted by the United Nations General Assembly on September 10, 1996, banning all nuclear explosions for both civilian and military purposes.",
