      "headline": "Sentencing of Soon Ja Du",
      "text": "In November 1991, Judge Joyce Karlin sentenced Soon Ja Du to 10 years in state prison, but the sentence was suspended. Du was instead placed on five years' probation, required to complete 400 hours of community service, and ordered to pay $500 in restitution and cover Harlins' funeral costs.",
