      "headline": "Riot Grrrl Convention",
      "text": "In July 1992, the first Riot Grrrl Convention was held in Washington, D.C., providing a platform for workshops, discussions, and performances centered around feminist punk.",
      "date": "1992-07"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Media Attention and Backlash",
      "text": "By the mid-1990s, Riot Grrrl began receiving significant media attention, which led to both increased visibility and backlash. The movement was often misunderstood and misrepresented in mainstream media.",
