      "headline": "First Ascent of Mount Everest",
      "text": "On May 29, 1953, Sir Edmund Hillary from New Zealand and Tenzing Norgay, a Sherpa of Nepal, became the first climbers confirmed to have reached the summit of Mount Everest, the highest point on Earth.",
