      "headline": "First Ascent of Cho Oyu",
      "text": "On October 19, 1954, an Austrian expedition led by Herbert Tichy, Joseph Jöchler, and Pasang Dawa Lama made the first successful ascent of Cho Oyu, the sixth-highest mountain in the world.",
      "date": "1954-10-19"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Ascent of Dhaulagiri I",
      "text": "On May 13, 1960, a Swiss-Austrian-Nepali expedition successfully reached the summit of Dhaulagiri I, the seventh-highest mountain in the world.",
      "date": "1960-05-13"
