      "text": "Lebensborn e.V. was established on December 12, 1935, by Heinrich Himmler. The organization aimed to increase the birth rate of 'racially pure' Aryan children through various means, including providing welfare to unmarried mothers and facilitating anonymous births.",
      "date": "1935-12-12"
