      "text": "Lot, the nephew of Abraham, travels with him from Ur to Haran and then to Canaan as recorded in Genesis 11:31 and Genesis 12:4-5. This journey marks the beginning of Lot's significant biblical narrative.",
      "date": "-0200"  },
