      "headline": "Capture and Rescue",
      "text": "Lot is captured during a raid by a coalition of kings but is rescued by Abraham, who defeats the captors. This event is detailed in Genesis 14:1-16.",
      "date": "-0200"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Destruction of Sodom and Gomorrah",
      "text": "Lot flees Sodom with his family as the city is destroyed by divine judgment. His wife looks back and becomes a pillar of salt, as narrated in Genesis 19:15-26.",
      "date": "-0200"
    },
