      "headline": "Lot and His Daughters",
      "text": "After the destruction of Sodom, Lot's daughters intoxicate him to have children, leading to the birth of Moab and Ben-Ammi, ancestors of the Moabites and Ammonites, as described in Genesis 19:30-38.",
      "date": "-0200"
    }
  ]
}

{
