      "text": "Crocodylomorph pseudosuchians, the ancestors of modern crocodilians, first appeared about 235 million years ago during the Late Triassic period.",
      "date": "-0235000000"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Survival of the Triassic–Jurassic Extinction Event",
      "text": "Crocodylomorph pseudosuchians were among the few archosaurs that survived the Triassic–Jurassic extinction event approximately 201 million years ago.",
