      "text": "Charles Cornwallis was born on December 31, 1738, in Grosvenor Square, London, England.",
      "date": "1738-12-31"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Enters the British Army",
      "text": "In 1756, Charles Cornwallis began his military career by purchasing a commission as an ensign in the British Army.",
      "date": "1756"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Promoted to Lieutenant Colonel",
      "text": "In 1761, Cornwallis was promoted to the rank of lieutenant colonel.",
      "date": "1761"
