      "headline": "American War of Independence",
      "text": "Cornwallis served as a leading British general in the American War of Independence, participating in several key battles from 1775 to 1781.",
      "date": "1775"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Surrender at Yorktown",
      "text": "On October 19, 1781, Cornwallis surrendered to American and French forces at the Siege of Yorktown, effectively ending major hostilities in the American Revolutionary War.",
      "date": "1781-10-19"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Appointed Governor-General of India",
      "text": "In 1786, Cornwallis was appointed as the Governor-General of India, where he implemented significant administrative reforms.",
