      "text": "Cao Xueqin began writing Dream of the Red Chamber during the Qing dynasty, likely in the 1740s. The novel reflects the author's own experiences and observations of the social and political landscape of the time.",
      "date": "1740"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Completion of the First Draft",
      "text": "By around 1763, Cao Xueqin completed the first draft of Dream of the Red Chamber, consisting of 80 chapters. This draft circulated among his friends and family.",
      "date": "1763"
    },
