      "headline": "Cao Xueqin's Death",
      "text": "Cao Xueqin passed away in 1763 or 1764, leaving the novel unfinished. His death marked the end of his direct involvement with the novel.",
      "date": "1764"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Cheng Weiyuan and Gao E's Edition",
      "text": "In 1791, Cheng Weiyuan and Gao E published the first printed edition of Dream of the Red Chamber, adding 40 additional chapters to complete the novel, bringing the total to 120 chapters.",
      "date": "1791"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Publication of the Complete Novel",
      "text": "The complete 120-chapter version of Dream of the Red Chamber was published in 1792, becoming widely available and solidifying its status as a classic of Chinese literature.",
      "date": "1792"
    }
  ]
