      "headline": "Founding of El Paso del Norte",
      "text": "El Paso del Norte, now known as Ciudad Juárez, was founded in 1659 by Spanish explorers as a mission settlement.",
      "date": "1659"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Mexican War of Independence",
      "text": "During the Mexican War of Independence, El Paso del Norte served as a refuge for Spanish loyalists fleeing the conflict. The war lasted from 1810 to 1821.",
