      "headline": "Appointed Minister of Science and Technology",
      "text": "In 2015, Abiy Ahmed was appointed as the Minister of Science and Technology in Ethiopia.",
      "date": "2015"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Became Chairman of the Oromo Democratic Party",
      "text": "Abiy Ahmed became the chairman of the Oromo Democratic Party (ODP) in February 2018.",
      "date": "2018-02"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Elected Prime Minister of Ethiopia",
      "text": "On April 2, 2018, Abiy Ahmed was elected as the Prime Minister of Ethiopia, becoming the first person of Oromo descent to hold the position.",
      "date": "2018-04-02"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Initiated Peace Agreement with Eritrea",
      "text": "In July 2018, Abiy Ahmed initiated a peace agreement with Eritrea, ending a 20-year border conflict.",
      "date": "2018-07"
