      "headline": "Outbreak of Civil War",
      "text": "Following the UN's partition plan, violence erupted between Jewish and Arab communities in Palestine. The civil war began immediately after the resolution was passed, with both sides engaging in attacks and counter-attacks.",
      "date": "1947-11-30"
    },
