      "text": "On April 25, 1185, the Minamoto clan decisively defeated the Taira clan at the Battle of Dan-no-ura, marking the end of the Genpei War.",
      "date": "1185-04-25"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Establishment of the Kamakura Shogunate",
      "text": "In 1192, Minamoto no Yoritomo established the Kamakura shogunate, becoming the first shogun of Japan and marking the beginning of the Kamakura period.",
      "date": "1192"
    },
    {
      "headline": "End of the Kamakura Shogunate",
      "text": "The Kamakura shogunate, established by the Minamoto clan, came to an end in 1333 when it was overthrown by forces loyal to the Emperor.",
