      "headline": "Referendum Result Announced",
      "text": "On 24 June 2016, the result of the referendum was announced, with 51.9% voting to leave the European Union and 48.1% voting to remain.",
      "date": "2016-06-24"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Prime Minister David Cameron Resigns",
      "text": "Following the referendum result, Prime Minister David Cameron announced his resignation on 24 June 2016, stating that a new leader should take the UK forward in negotiations with the EU.",
      "date": "2016-06-24"
    },
