      "headline": "Surviving Works of Epicurus",
      "text": "Only three letters written by Epicurus—the letters to Menoeceus, Pythocles, and Herodotus—and two collections of quotes—the Principal Doctrines and the Vatican Sayings—have survived intact.",
      "date": "-0300"
