      "headline": "Ceded to Bahmani Kings",
      "text": "The fort was ceded to the Bahmani Kings from the Musunuri Nayakas during the reign of the Bahmani Sultan Mohammed Shah I, during the first Bahmani-Vijayanagar War.",
