      "text": "In 1925, Copland's 'Symphony for Organ and Orchestra' premiered in New York City, conducted by Walter Damrosch.",
      "date": "1925"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Major Ballet Score",
      "text": "In 1938, Copland composed his first major ballet score, 'Billy the Kid', which premiered that same year.",
      "date": "1938"
