      "text": "The term 'mechatronics' was first coined by Tetsuro Mori, an engineer at Yaskawa Electric Corporation, in 1969. It was used to describe the synergistic integration of mechanical engineering with electronics and intelligent computer control in the design and manufacture of products and processes.",
