      "date": "2010"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Current Trends in Mechatronics",
      "text": "As of the 2020s, mechatronics continues to evolve with emerging technologies like machine learning, smart sensors, and advanced materials. These innovations are driving new applications in areas such as healthcare, aerospace, and renewable energy.",
