    },
    {
      "headline": "Dutch Control of the Cape Colony",
      "text": "The Dutch established a settlement at the Cape of Good Hope in 1652, which became a crucial resupply station for ships traveling to and from Asia.",
      "date": "1652"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Fourth Anglo-Dutch War",
      "text": "The Fourth Anglo-Dutch War (1780-1784) resulted in significant losses for the Dutch, including the loss of many colonial possessions.",
