      "text": "In 1895, Durkheim published 'The Rules of Sociological Method', outlining the methodology of sociology as a discipline.",
      "date": "1895"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Founding of the First European Department of Sociology",
      "text": "Durkheim founded the first European department of sociology at the University of Bordeaux in 1895.",
      "date": "1895"
