      "headline": "First Record Over 100 km/h",
      "text": "On April 29, 1899, Camille Jenatzy became the first person to break the 100 km/h barrier, reaching a speed of 105.88 km/h (65.79 mph) in his electric vehicle, La Jamais Contente.",
      "date": "1899-04-29"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Record Over 200 km/h",
      "text": "Henry Segrave set a new land speed record on March 29, 1927, becoming the first to exceed 200 km/h, reaching 203.79 km/h (126.75 mph) in the Sunbeam 1000 hp.",
      "date": "1927-03-29"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Record Over 300 km/h",
      "text": "Malcolm Campbell broke the 300 km/h barrier on February 19, 1931, reaching a speed of 396.04 km/h (246.09 mph) in the Blue Bird.",
      "date": "1931-02-19"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Record Over 400 km/h",
      "text": "On September 3, 1935, Malcolm Campbell set a new record, becoming the first to exceed 400 km/h, reaching 484.62 km/h (301.13 mph) in the Blue Bird.",
      "date": "1935-09-03"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Record Over 600 km/h",
      "text": "Craig Breedlove set a new land speed record on October 13, 1964, reaching 600.601 km/h (373.823 mph) in the Spirit of America.",
      "date": "1964-10-13"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Record Over 1,000 km/h",
      "text": "On October 23, 1970, Gary Gabelich set a new record, becoming the first to exceed 1,000 km/h, reaching 1,014.656 km/h (630.388 mph) in the Blue Flame.",
      "date": "1970-10-23"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Record Over 1,200 km/h",
      "text": "Richard Noble set a new land speed record on October 4, 1983, reaching 1,019.468 km/h (633.468 mph) in the Thrust2.",
      "date": "1983-10-04"
