      "headline": "Pu'er Tea in the Ming Dynasty",
      "text": "During the Ming Dynasty (1368-1644), the production and popularity of Pu'er tea increased significantly. It became a tribute tea, meaning it was offered as a tribute to the emperor.",
      "date": "1368"
