      "headline": "Creation of Nazca Lines - Nazca Phase",
      "text": "The Nazca phase, from 200 BCE to 500 CE, saw the continuation and expansion of the Nazca Lines. This period is characterized by the creation of more complex and numerous geoglyphs.",
