      "headline": "Role in the Trojan War",
      "text": "Ajax the Great played a significant role in the Trojan War, which is traditionally dated to around 1194–1184 BCE. He was known for his immense size and strength, second only to Achilles among the Greek warriors.",
      "date": "-1194"
