      "headline": "Creation of Pong",
      "text": "Allan Alcorn created Pong as a training exercise assigned to him by Atari co-founder Nolan Bushnell. Bushnell and Atari co-founder Ted Dabney were impressed by the quality of Alcorn's work and decided to manufacture the game.",
