      "headline": "Magnavox Lawsuit",
      "text": "In response to Pong's release, Magnavox sued Atari for patent infringement, claiming that Pong was based on an electronic ping-pong game included in the Magnavox Odyssey, the first home video game console.",
      "date": "1974"
