      "headline": "Birth of Robert Baden-Powell",
      "text": "Robert Stephenson Smyth Baden-Powell was born on February 22, 1857, in Paddington, London, England.",
      "date": "1857-02-22"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Enters Charterhouse School",
      "text": "In 1870, Baden-Powell began attending Charterhouse School, a prestigious boarding school in Surrey.",
      "date": "1870"
