    {
      "headline": "The Napalm Attack",
      "text": "On June 8, 1972, Phan Thị Kim Phúc was photographed running naked on a road after being severely burned by a napalm attack during the Vietnam War. This photograph, taken by Nick Ut, became iconic and won the Pulitzer Prize.",
