      "headline": "Introduction of the X Rating",
      "text": "The X rating was introduced by the Motion Picture Association of America (MPAA) in 1968 as part of a new film rating system. It was intended to designate films suitable only for adults, typically those containing explicit sexual content or graphic violence.",
      "date": "1968"
    },
