      "headline": "Battle of Bosworth Field",
      "text": "The Battle of Bosworth Field was fought on 22 August 1485. It was the last significant battle of the Wars of the Roses, a civil war between the houses of Lancaster and York. The battle was won by an alliance of Lancastrians and disaffected Yorkists, led by Henry Tudor, Earl of Richmond.",
      "date": "1485-08-22"
