      "headline": "Establishment of the Edinburgh Phrenological Society",
      "text": "The principal British centre for phrenology was Edinburgh, where the Edinburgh Phrenological Society was established in 1820. This society played a significant role in the promotion and study of phrenology.",
      "date": "1820"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Decline of Phrenology",
      "text": "By the mid-19th century, phrenology began to decline as it was increasingly discredited by empirical research and the advancement of neuroscience.",
