      "text": "On June 28, 1969, the Stonewall Riots began in New York City. These were a series of spontaneous demonstrations by members of the LGBTQ community in response to a police raid at the Stonewall Inn, a gay bar in Greenwich Village. The riots are widely considered a catalyst for the modern LGBTQ rights movement.",
