      "text": "On the morning of Saturday, 1 November 1755, at around 09:40 local time, a massive earthquake struck Lisbon, Portugal. The earthquake had a magnitude of 7.7 or greater on the moment magnitude scale, with its epicenter in the Atlantic Ocean about 200 km west-southwest of Cape St. Vincent.",
      "date": "1755-11-01"
    },
