      "headline": "Tsunami and Fires Devastate Lisbon",
      "text": "Following the earthquake on 1 November 1755, a tsunami and subsequent fires further devastated Lisbon and adjoining areas, almost completely destroying the city.",
      "date": "1755-11-01"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Impact on the Iberian Peninsula and Northwest Africa",
      "text": "The 1755 Lisbon earthquake, along with the tsunami and fires, impacted not only Portugal but also the wider Iberian Peninsula and Northwest Africa, causing widespread destruction.",
      "date": "1755-11-01"
    },
