      "headline": "Launch of Skylab",
      "text": "Skylab, the United States' first space station, was launched by NASA on May 14, 1973.",
      "date": "1973-05-14"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Skylab 2 Mission Begins",
      "text": "The first crewed mission to Skylab, known as Skylab 2, was launched on May 25, 1973. The crew repaired damage sustained during launch and conducted experiments.",
      "date": "1973-05-25"
