    {
      "headline": "Renaissance Fresco Revival",
      "text": "The Renaissance period saw a revival of fresco painting, with artists such as Giotto, Masaccio, and Michelangelo employing the technique to create masterpieces like the Sistine Chapel ceiling (1508-1512).",
      "date": "1508"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Baroque Fresco Painting",
      "text": "In the Baroque period, fresco painting continued to be popular, with artists like Pietro da Cortona and Gian Lorenzo Bernini creating grand frescoes in palaces and churches.",
      "date": "1600"
    },
    {
