      "text": "Titian was born around 1488-1490 in Pieve di Cadore, near Belluno, in the Republic of Venice.",
      "date": "1488"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Apprenticeship in Venice",
      "text": "Around 1500, Titian moved to Venice to begin his apprenticeship with the famous Venetian painter Giovanni Bellini.",
      "date": "1500"
