      "text": "The United Nations Interim Force in Lebanon (UNIFIL) was established on 19 March 1978 by United Nations Security Council Resolutions 425 and 426. The mission was created in response to the 1978 South Lebanon conflict, which occurred in the context of Palestinian insurgency in South Lebanon and the Lebanese Civil War.",
