      "text": "On August 11, 2006, the United Nations Security Council unanimously adopted Resolution 1701. The resolution called for a full cessation of hostilities between Israel and Hezbollah, the withdrawal of Hezbollah and other forces from Lebanon south of the Litani River, and the disarmament of Hezbollah and other armed groups.",
      "date": "2006-08-11"
