      "headline": "Destruction During the American Revolution",
      "text": "On January 1, 1776, much of Norfolk was destroyed by fire during the American Revolutionary War. The fire was set by British forces and spread by American forces to prevent British occupation.",
      "date": "1776-01-01"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Incorporation as a City",
      "text": "Norfolk was incorporated as a city in 1845, reflecting its continued growth and development.",
      "date": "1845"
    },
