      "text": "On September 4, 1999, the first bombing occurred in Buynaksk, Dagestan, where a truck bomb exploded outside a five-story apartment building housing Russian military families, killing 64 people.",
      "date": "1999-09-04"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Moscow Bombing",
