      "text": "The Thule Society's membership list included early Nazi sympathizers and leading figures in Munich, such as Rudolf Hess, Alfred Rosenberg, Hans Frank, Julius Lehmann, Gottfried Feder, Dietrich Eckart, and Karl Harrer. This influence was crucial in the formation of Nazi ideology.",
