      "text": "The Net Promoter Score (NPS) was developed by Fred Reichheld, in conjunction with Bain & Company and Satmetrix. It is a market research metric based on a single survey question asking respondents to rate the likelihood that they would recommend a company, product, or service to a friend or colleague.",
