      "date": "2003-12"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Trademark Registration",
      "text": "The Net Promoter Score became a registered trademark owned by Fred Reichheld, Bain & Company, and Satmetrix, solidifying its proprietary status.",
      "date": "2004"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Publication of 'The Ultimate Question'",
      "text": "In 2006, Fred Reichheld published the book 'The Ultimate Question: Driving Good Profits and True Growth', which further elaborated on the NPS methodology and its application in business.",
      "date": "2006"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Introduction of NPS 2.0",
      "text": "In 2011, the concept of NPS 2.0 was introduced, which included enhancements and refinements to the original NPS methodology, incorporating more sophisticated analytics and feedback mechanisms.",
