      "headline": "Research at the University of Michigan",
      "text": "In 1942, Jonas Salk joined the University of Michigan School of Public Health, where he worked on developing an influenza vaccine.",
      "date": "1942"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Appointment at the University of Pittsburgh",
      "text": "In 1947, Jonas Salk was appointed as the head of the Virus Research Lab at the University of Pittsburgh.",
      "date": "1947"
