      "headline": "Establishment in North Africa",
      "text": "By 439 CE, the Alans, in alliance with the Vandals, had established themselves in North Africa, capturing Carthage and creating a kingdom that lasted until the Byzantine reconquest.",
      "date": "0439"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Byzantine Reconquest",
      "text": "The Byzantine Empire, under Emperor Justinian I, reconquered the Vandal-Alan kingdom in North Africa in 534 CE.",
      "date": "0534"
