      "headline": "Aftermath and Investigation",
      "text": "Following the shooting, investigations revealed that Mateen had pledged allegiance to the Islamic State of Iraq and the Levant (ISIL) during the attack. The incident prompted widespread discussions on gun control, terrorism, and LGBTQ+ rights.",
