      "text": "The zoot suit originated in the late 1930s among African American communities in urban areas such as Harlem, New York City. It was characterized by its exaggerated style, including high-waisted, wide-legged, tight-cuffed trousers, and a long coat with wide lapels and padded shoulders.",
