      "text": "According to the gospels of Matthew and Luke, Jesus was born in Bethlehem, in Roman-controlled Judea. His mother, Mary, was engaged to Joseph, who was descended from King David. The birth was caused by divine intervention. The exact date is not known, but it is traditionally celebrated on December 25th.",
