      "text": "In 2008, the Arecibo Observatory detected prebiotic molecules in a distant galaxy, contributing to the understanding of the chemical complexity of the universe.",
      "date": "2008"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Damage from Earthquake",
      "text": "In January 2020, the Arecibo Observatory sustained damage from a series of earthquakes that struck Puerto Rico.",
      "date": "2020-01"
