      "headline": "Capture of Dedan Kimathi",
      "text": "On October 21, 1956, Dedan Kimathi, a prominent leader of the Mau Mau, was captured by British forces, marking a significant turning point in the rebellion.",
      "date": "1956-10-21"
    },
    {
      "headline": "End of the Mau Mau Rebellion",
      "text": "The Mau Mau rebellion officially ended in 1960, although the state of emergency was lifted in 1959, marking the conclusion of the conflict between the KLFA and British authorities.",
      "date": "1960"
    },
