      "headline": "FDA Approval for Suicidal Behavior",
      "text": "In 2002, the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) approved clozapine for reducing the risk of suicidal behavior in patients with schizophrenia or schizoaffective disorder.",
      "date": "2002"
    },
