      "headline": "Commemoration of Qu Yuan",
      "text": "The Dragon Boat Festival commemorates Qu Yuan, a beloved prime minister of the southern Chinese state of Chu during the Warring States period, approximately between 600 BCE and 200 BCE. Qu Yuan is remembered for his patriotism and contributions to Chinese culture.",
