      "headline": "Introduction of Mainframe Computers",
      "text": "Mainframe computers were introduced in the 1950s. They were used primarily by large organizations for critical applications such as bulk data processing, enterprise resource planning, and large-scale transaction processing.",
      "date": "1950"
    },
