    },
    {
      "headline": "Carolingian Synthesis",
      "text": "Scholars believe that Gregorian chant arose from a Carolingian synthesis of the Old Roman chant and Gallican chant, rather than being invented by Pope Gregory I.",
      "date": "0900"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Popular Legend of Pope Gregory I",
      "text": "Although popular legend credits Pope Gregory I with inventing Gregorian chant, this is not supported by historical evidence. The legend likely arose due to the association of his name with the chant.",
      "date": "0900"
