      "headline": "Signing of the North Atlantic Treaty",
      "text": "The North Atlantic Treaty, also known as the Washington Treaty, was signed in Washington, D.C., on 4 April 1949. This treaty forms the legal basis of, and is implemented by, the North Atlantic Treaty Organization (NATO).",
      "date": "1949-04-04"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Entry into Force",
      "text": "The North Atlantic Treaty entered into force on 24 August 1949, after the necessary ratifications were completed by the signatory countries.",
      "date": "1949-08-24"
