    {
      "headline": "San Francisco Peace Treaty",
      "text": "The 1951 San Francisco Peace Treaty officially ended World War II, with Japan renouncing claims to the Kuril Islands, though the treaty did not specify the sovereignty of the islands.",
      "date": "1951"
