    {
      "headline": "Greek Coup and Turkish Invasion",
      "text": "On July 15, 1974, a coup d'état by Greek Cypriot nationalists and the Greek military junta overthrew President Makarios. In response, Turkey invaded Cyprus on July 20, 1974.",
      "date": "1974-07-20"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Division of Cyprus",
      "text": "Following the Turkish invasion, Cyprus was effectively divided into the Greek Cypriot-controlled south and the Turkish Cypriot-controlled north. This division remains to this day.",
      "date": "1974"
